.\" Man page for pip-rns
.\" vim: ft=man
.TH PIP-RNS 1 "2026-05-30" "1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
pip-rns \- Install Python packages from Reticulum rns:// git remotes
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B pip-rns
[\fB--no-color\fR] [\fB--config\fR \fIDIR\fR]
.I command
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Install Python packages directly from Reticulum rns:// git remotes
via pip, pipx, uv, or poetry. Supports version pinning, offline
caching, editable installs, local aliases, remote package indexes,
and rngit release installs.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS install
Install a package from a remote.
.B pip-rns install
[\fB--pipx\fR] [\fB--uv\fR] [\fB--poetry\fR] [\fB--ref\fR \fITAG\fR]
[\fB--editable\fR] [\fB--use-cache\fR] [\fB--venv\fR \fIPATH\fR]
[\fB--from-release\fR] [\fB--verify\fR \fIIDENTITY\fR]
\fIremote\fR [\fB--\fR \fItool-flags\fR]
.SS update
Reinstall a package from a remote, forcing a fresh install.
.SS list
List installed packages (uses pip by default; add --pipx, --uv, or --poetry).
.SS uninstall
Uninstall a package via the chosen backend.
.SS alias
Manage local aliases: add, set, rm, ls.
.SS index
Manage remote package indexes: add, rm, ls, sync, list, search.
.SS release
List or view releases on remote repos (via rngit).
.B pip-rns release list \fIremote\fR
.B pip-rns release view \fIremote\fR \fItag\fR
.SS bundle
Install or verify offline .opip bundles (via opip).
.B pip-rns bundle install \fISOURCE\fR [\fB--signer\fR \fIIDENTITY\fR]
.B pip-rns bundle verify \fIBUNDLE\fR
.SH EXAMPLES
.B Install from RNS remote:
.RS
pip-rns install 06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc/public/LXMFy --break-system-packages
.RE
.B Install via pipx:
.RS
pipx-rns install 06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc/public/LXMFy
.RE
.B Pin a version:
.RS
pip-rns install repo@v1.0.0
.RE
.B Install from a release (no build):
.RS
pip-rns install --from-release rns://06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc/public/rns-page-node --ref v1.6.0
.RE
.B Install and verify release signer:
.RS
pip-rns install --from-release rns://id/group/repo --ref v1.0.0 --verify e46112d44649266d71fe2193e00a4710
.RE
.B List releases:
.RS
pip-rns release list rns://06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc/public/rns-page-node
pip-rns release view rns://06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc/public/rns-page-node v1.6.0
.RE
.B Use a local alias:
.RS
pip-rns alias add lxmfy 06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc/public/LXMFy
pip-rns install lxmfy
.RE
.B Sync an index and install:
.RS
pip-rns index add rns://06a54b505bb67b25ef3f8097e8001edc/public/index
pip-rns index sync
pip-rns index search lxmf
pip-rns install lxmfy
.RE
.B Pass flags to the underlying tool:
.RS
pip-rns install identity/group/repo -- --break-system-packages
.RE
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PIP_RNS_PIP
pip command (default: pip)
.TP
.B PIP_RNS_PIPX
pipx command (default: pipx)
.TP
.B PIP_RNS_UV
uv command (default: uv)
.TP
.B PIP_RNS_POETRY
poetry command (default: poetry)
.TP
.B PIP_RNS_CONFIG
config directory for aliases and indexes
.TP
.B PIP_RNS_USE_CACHE
enable offline cache (1)
.TP
.B PIP_RNS_COLOR
disable colors (0)
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
disable colors (standard)
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/pip-rns/aliases
Local alias definitions (one per line: name=remote)
.TP
.I ~/.config/pip-rns/indexes
Registered index URLs (one per line)
.TP
.I ~/.local/share/pip-rns/
Cached clones, synced index data, and editable checkouts
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR pipx-rns (1),
.BR rngit (1),
.BR git-remote-rns (1)
